Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 01:07:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] alibabacloud: attach and retain ESSD data disks

Attach the requested data disks to the new instance and preserve them
when deleting the PodVM. Use the CRI sandbox ID as the native
RunInstances ClientToken and reconcile attachment state through ECS
queries.

Discover current attachments during deletion, require safe retention
settings for attached data disks, and wait for their release. Keep
cancellation and cloud errors visible; apply retained-disk lock checks
only when data disks exist.

